## 7. Health and privacy notice

RUNWILD is not a medical device. Distance, pace, and calorie values are
estimates, not medical measurements. Consult a professional before starting a
new exercise program if you have health concerns.

Location data stays on the device and in the user's own Firebase project when
configured. Do not upload other people's location data without consent.

